{"id":"61015b29c34a1c82","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-ci-uniformity-null-number.md","title":"ZFC CI Uniformity Null Number","display":"df-zfc-ci-uniformity-null-number — ZFC CI Uniformity Null Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ci-uniformity-null-number","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ci-uniformity-null-number"],"display":"df-zfc-ci-uniformity-null-number — ZFC CI Uniformity Null Number","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-lebesgue]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ci-uniformity-null-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ci-uniformity-null-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ci-uniformity-null-number — ZFC CI Uniformity Null Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"58-df-lebesgue\">58-df-lebesgue</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal N,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^*:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\to[0,\\infty]\">\\(\\lambda^*:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\to[0,\\infty]\\)</span> (Lebesgue outer measure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"58-df-lebesgue\">58-df-lebesgue</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiUniformityNullNumber}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiUniformityNullNumber}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对非空序数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min C\">\\(\\min C\\)</span> 为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)\">\\(m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)\\)</span> 的唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>；此记号仅在其非空域使用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}uniformity\\text{-}null\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiUniformityNullNumber}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal N=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\lambda^*(A)=0\\}\\land\\kappa=\\min\\{|X|:X\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land X\\notin\\mathcal N\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}uniformity\\text{-}null\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiUniformityNullNumber}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal N=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\lambda^*(A)=0\\}\\land\\kappa=\\min\\{|X|:X\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land X\\notin\\mathcal N\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-lebesgue","status":"resolved","id":"68427bc628af9b8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-lebesgue]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-lebesgue","status":"resolved","id":"68427bc628af9b8d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\lambda^*:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\to[0,\\infty]$ (Lebesgue outer measure, see [[58-df-lebesgue]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal N,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^*:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\to[0,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCiUniformityNullNumber}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"